        <body>
            <div xml:id="d192">

                <pb facs="0415" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg101"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/836</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Roumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vopicka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-10T17:00:00+01:44">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">September 10, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 11, 6:53 a.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Consul at Belgrade reports that Servian forces have taken Sem and surrounding
                    country. Roumanian Government appears ready to take action shortly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
